  "failureReasons": [
    "822 source control sites were never reached at runtime. They are control sites, not activities, but they are unreconciled: they may hide instances the crawl cannot reach.",
    "2257 rendered control groups (596 distinct lesson+component) emit no task marker, so their activity-instance count cannot be established. Discovery is not a denominator.",
    "engines without an exact architecture↔render agreement: final-quiz (26/314 expected vs 24/288 rendered); lesson-exercise (data-exercise values are partly dynamic; the source gives only a literal floor, so no exact architecture-side count exists)",
    "2 engine instances expected by the architecture were never reached by the discovery crawl: L17 final-quiz (step-cap, 200 steps); L25 final-quiz (html-stable-after-next, 45 steps)",
    "46 in-scope instances that require checking/submission have no per-instance behavioral certification (Lesson 2 standard): L1/final-quiz/1, L2/final-quiz/2, L3/final-quiz/3, L4/final-quiz/4, L5/final-quiz/5, L6/final-quiz/6, L7/final-quiz/7, L8/final-quiz/8, L9/final-quiz/9, L10/final-quiz/10, L11/final-quiz/11, L12/final-quiz/12, … +34 more",
    "11 in-scope instances could not be driven through answer→submit→feedback→reset by the generic harness, so their reset and feedback timing are unproven",
    "per-instance certification covers 5 of 76 enumerated instances (Five named source exercise instances only; NOT whole-course certification)"
  ]
